{"id":"82d6ef94a29a616f","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-relative-kleene-post.md","title":"Kleene–Post 定理的相对版本","display":"thm-relative-kleene-post — Kleene–Post 定理的相对版本","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-relative-kleene-post","aliases":["20-thm-relative-kleene-post"],"display":"thm-relative-kleene-post — Kleene–Post 定理的相对版本","chapter":"6","section":"6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 6.1.2","source_printed_pages":[133],"source_pdf_pages":[167],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","[[20-df-join]]","[[20-df-degle]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-relative-kleene-post"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-relative-kleene-post</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-relative-kleene-post — Kleene–Post 定理的相对版本"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 6.1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>133</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>167</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"02c10d5d18aba717\" href=\"?note=02c10d5d18aba717\" title=\"20-thm-kleene-post\">20-thm-kleene-post</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"08b4fd5163a7f955\" href=\"?note=08b4fd5163a7f955\" title=\"20-df-join\">20-df-join</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf c&#39;\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\not\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\not\\le\\mathbf a].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}relative\\text{-}kleene\\text{-}post}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D\\ [\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a\\land\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf c&#39;\\land\\mathbf b\\le\\mathbf c&#39;\\land\\mathbf a\\not\\le\\mathbf b\\land\\mathbf b\\not\\le\\mathbf a].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf c\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf c\\)</span>，相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 构造 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\le_TC&#39;\">\\(X,Y\\le_TC&#39;\\)</span>。处理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\Phi_e^{Y\\oplus C}\">\\(X\\ne\\Phi_e^{Y\\oplus C}\\)</span> 时，问是否有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的当前有限前缀的延伸，使该计算在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 下停止；这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>-c.e. 问题，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C&#39;\">\\(C&#39;\\)</span> 可判定。有则延伸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的新位异于结果，无则永久发散。交换两列完成另一方向。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(X\\oplus C)\">\\(\\mathbf a=\\deg_T(X\\oplus C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(Y\\oplus C)\">\\(\\mathbf b=\\deg_T(Y\\oplus C)\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\oplus C\\le_TY\\oplus C\">\\(X\\oplus C\\le_TY\\oplus C\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\le_TY\\oplus C\">\\(X\\le_TY\\oplus C\\)</span>，违背要求；另一方向同理。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 6.1.2；印刷页 133；PDF 第 167 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-kleene-post","status":"resolved","id":"02c10d5d18aba717","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-kleene-post]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-join","status":"resolved","id":"08b4fd5163a7f955","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm